#: data/ui/import/columns/item-group.blp:73 data/ui/import/spreadsheet/item-group.blp:73
msgid ""
"<b>X Value Calculation</b>\n"
"\n"
"Enter an equation to calculate X values.\n"
"Use 'n' for the row index (starting from 0).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Examples:</b>\n"
"• <b>n</b> → 0, 1, 2, 3, 4…\n"
"• <b>n*0.5</b> → 0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0…\n"
"• <b>n^2</b> → 0, 1, 4, 9, 16…\n"
"• <b>2^n</b> → 1, 2, 4, 8, 16…\n"
"• <b>n*10+100</b> → 100, 110, 120, 130…"
msgstr ""
"<b>X-värdesberäkning</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ange en ekvation för att beräkna X-värden.\n"
"Använd ”n” för radindexet (med start från 0).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Exempel:</b>\n"
"• <b>n</b> → 0, 1, 2, 3, 4…\n"
"• <b>n*0.5</b> → 0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0…\n"
"• <b>n^2</b> → 0, 1, 4, 9, 16…\n"
"• <b>2^n</b> → 1, 2, 4, 8, 16…\n"
"• <b>n*10+100</b> → 100, 110, 120, 130…"

