#: data/ui/import/columns/main-group.blp:43
msgid ""
"<b>Uses regex pattern matching</b>\n"
"\n"
"These characters have special meanings in regex syntax:\n"
"<b>. * + ? [ ] ^ $ | \\ ( ) { }</b>\n"
"\n"
"To match these characters literally, escape them with <b>\\</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Examples:</b>\n"
"• <b>\\.</b> matches a period\n"
"• <b>\\*</b> matches an asterisk\n"
"• <b>\\|</b> matches a pipe character\n"
"\n"
"<a href='https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-syntax'>Learn more about regex "
"syntax…</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Använder matchning med reguljära uttryck</b>\n"
"\n"
"Dessa tecken har särskilda betydelser i syntaxen för reguljära uttryck:\n"
"<b>. * + ? [ ] ^ $ | \\ ( ) { }</b>\n"
"\n"
"För att matcha dessa tecken bokstavligen, föregå dem med <b>\\</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Exempel:</b>\n"
"• <b>\\.</b> matchar en punkt\n"
"• <b>\\*</b> matchar en asterisk\n"
"• <b>\\|</b> matchar tecknet |\n"
"\n"
"<a href='https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-syntax'>Läs mer om syntaxen för "
"reguljära uttryck…</a>"

